  ozelFonksiyon: "tarot ge\xE7mi\u015F sohbeti ba\u015Flat"
  aciklama:
  - "Ge\xE7mi\u015Fin i\xE7in \"K\u0131l\u0131\xE7 Be\u015Flisi\" kart\u0131n\u0131
    \"ters\" se\xE7tin.\n\nKorkular\u0131n\u0131n ve teredd\xFCtlerinin seni muallakta
    b\u0131rakt\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 s\xF6yl\xFCyor kart\u0131n. Cesaretle giri\u015Fmeli,
    s\xF6z\xFCn\xFC korkmadan s\xF6ylemeli ve do\u011Fru bildi\u011Fin konularda
    \u0131srarc\u0131 olmal\u0131yd\u0131n {{isim}}. Bir tu\u011Flaya korkarak yumruk
    atarsan, tu\u011Fla k\u0131r\u0131lmad\u0131\u011F\u0131 gibi elin de yaralan\u0131r.
    Do\u011Fru g\xFCc\xFC uygularsan tu\u011Flan\u0131n direncini h\u0131zla k\u0131rar,
    vurdu\u011Fun anda par\xE7alara ay\u0131r\u0131rs\u0131n. Dirence kar\u015F\u0131
    korku ve karars\u0131zl\u0131k zararl\u0131d\u0131r. Neyse ki kafandaki t\xFCm
    soru i\u015Faretlerini geride b\u0131rakt\u0131racak donan\u0131ma ula\u015Fm\u0131\u015F,
    d\xFC\u015Fmanlar\u0131ndan daha avantajl\u0131 bir hale gelmi\u015Fsin. Sevdi\u011Fin
    insanlar senden daha \xE7ok etkilenmi\u015F ve seni daha fazla benimsemi\u015Fler.
    \xDCst\xFCnl\xFC\u011F\xFCn\xFC nihayet kan\u0131tlam\u0131\u015Fs\u0131n."
